  "date": "2026-10-27",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "江苏高校11月起，教职工工资进入数字人民币钱包",
  "title_en": "From November, Jiangsu University Staff Salaries Go into Digital Yuan Wallets",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "近日，江苏的几所大学发出通知：从2026年11月开始，学校的在编教职工，工资会发到数字人民币钱包里。",
      "en": "Recently, several universities in Jiangsu issued notices: starting in November 2026, the salaries of the schools' permanent staff will be paid into digital yuan wallets."
    },
    {
      "zh": "扬州大学财务处在10月20日发了通知，要求教职工在10月23日以前开通并升级数字人民币钱包。通知说，这个安排来自江苏省财政厅先发来的通知。",
      "en": "The finance office of Yangzhou University sent a notice on October 20, asking staff to open and upgrade their digital yuan wallets before October 23. The notice says this arrangement comes from an earlier notice from the Jiangsu provincial finance department."
    },
    {
      "zh": "南通大学要求教职工在10月30日以前完成开通。工资和绩效分别发在两张银行卡上，所以两张卡都要开通钱包。",
      "en": "Nantong University asks staff to finish opening their wallets before October 30. Salary and performance pay are paid onto two separate bank cards, so both cards need a wallet."
    },
    {
      "zh": "数字人民币是中国人民银行发行的数字货币。如果想使用数字人民币，要先在手机上安装它的App，开一个钱包，然后从银行卡转钱进去。这些消息在10月26日被媒体报道。",
      "en": "The digital yuan is a digital currency issued by the People's Bank of China. If you want to use it, you first install its app on your phone, open a wallet, and then transfer money into it from your bank card. This news was reported by the media on October 26."
    }
  ],
